                <p>A $200 non-refundable deposit is required to book ($400 for 2-Day Back to Back). Goes directly toward your tattoo — not an extra fee.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-item">
                <h3>What Affects Price</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Size of the tattoo</li>
                    <li>Level of detail</li>
                    <li>Placement on body</li>
                    <li>Custom design complexity</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-item">
                <h3>Payment</h3>
                <p>All major payment methods accepted securely through Stripe.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Credit &amp; debit cards</li>
                    <li>Digital wallets</li>
                    <li>3% processing fee applies to card payments</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-item">
                <h3>Cancellations</h3>
                <p>All deposits are non-refundable. No exceptions.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Reschedule with 48+ hours notice: One-time reschedule allowed</li>
                    <li>Reschedule under 48 hours: Deposit forfeited</li>
                    <li>No-shows: Deposit forfeited, new deposit required to rebook</li>
